@node PART_01 "Introduction"

Sometimes it is hard to find a file in a BBS, especially if there are
many conferences. All ZippySearches that I have found only scans the
conference you are joined. There I decided to code a new ZippySearcher
that actually scans all conferences you have access to.
@endnode

@node PART_02 "Requirements"

What U need to run it...
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

 - an Amigamodel (A500/A600/A1200/A2000/A3000/A4000) with Kickstart 2.04++

 - the installed /X-Software (V3.20+) in the drawer BBS:

Now let's go on by explaining the @{"Installation" LINK PART_03}...

@endnode

@node PART_03 "Installation for ZippySearcher 1.03"

How to install it to your /X-System...
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

First make a Drawer into Doors: called 'MDB-Search' and copy the Files
 - 'MDB-Search'
 - 'MDB-Search.INFO'
into it.

Second copy the Icon 'Z.INFO' into the BBSCmd Drawer.

Thats all there is. Simple he!

@endnode

